{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國男星孔劉上周六首度在澳門舉行粉絲見面會，活動上他大展歌喉，演唱MEOMURU的《The Adult I Dreamed Of》、郭真言的《Boast》及John Park的《That Song》等歌曲，又回顧過往拍過的作品。</p><p>粉絲為孔劉準</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T03:51:42.977748+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T03:36:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T03:45:08.824264+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T03:45:08.824264+00:00","content_hash":"945d68986142268ea29fb0356d0ec44b6ecb8b3ca8a91a159fcb185c29198e3a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}